        <note type="comparison" source="#whitelock" n="468"><label>expanded from</label> <ref target="clause:VIIIAtr_33">VIII Atr 33</ref> <quote>Expanded from VIII Ethelred 33</quote></note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares VIII Atr 33 f.; BR: added from Gesetze I p. 341, October 2026 (MS Cons); AY: corrected against Rabin p. 278 / 279, October 2026 (was “Đæt”, now “Ðæt”)</note>
